# PAYSCAPE-X environment variables
#
# Each application keeps its own environment template. Copy the relevant
# file and fill in real values — never commit actual credentials.
#
#   Backend:  backend/.env.example  ->  backend/.env
#   Frontend: frontend/.env.example ->  frontend/.env.local
#
# Backend (FastAPI):
#   DATABASE_URL, CORS_ORIGINS, APP_ENV, LOG_LEVEL, DEMO_MODE ...
#
# Frontend (Next.js):
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL, NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_MODE, NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_ENV ...
#
# See the per-application .env.example files for every option.
